// PY-A: sorted(xs[, reverse=]) 与 d.items()（键经侧表还原为原串）
//   断言与迭代顺序无关；sorted 的 key= 仍不接受 → 链接期报错（fail-loud），不会静默错排
// expect: [1, 2, 3]
// expect: [3, 2, 1]
// expect: 21
xs = [3, 1, 2]
print(sorted(xs))
print(sorted(xs, reverse=True))

d = {"a": 1, "b": 2}
total = 0
for k, v in d.items():
    if k == "a":
        total = total + v
    if k == "b":
        total = total + v * 10
print(total)
